{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon","id":1243832,"title":"Deviant at GenCon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-08T10:04:52-07:00","id":1243832,"title":"Deviant at GenCon?","content":"Did anyone get a chance to take a look at the Deviant manuscript at GenCon? Any juicy bits to reveal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T10:18:10-07:00","id":1243837,"title":"","content":"The Deviant manuscript was at GenCon this year?<br /> <br /> EDIT: ...and I just now noticed the previous thread in Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T10:34:11-07:00","id":1243844,"title":"","content":"I just really want to know about the Clades,so I can start building characters in my head","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T20:20:38-07:00","id":1244358,"title":"","content":"Here's some stuff from an anonymous who playtested<br /> <br /> Sure. Nothing at the session was really secret, though there\u2019s a handful of details I can\u2019t recall off the top of my head and some stuff might change since this was also kind of a playtest session. Our characters were members of a military unit that wound up tricked into participating in an unauthorized super-soldier program and went rogue on our first mission. The story of the one-shot is that an FBI agent masquerading as a reporter was in touch with our group and fed us intel about a facility where the folks that turned us into Deviants were still at it. Officially, we were supposed to break in steal evidence of what they were doing and get it back to our contact, with the out-of-character understanding that we were probably going to completely wreck the place up in the process.<br /> <br /> Spoiler alert: We completely wrecked the place up in the process. But we also saved another group of recruits from being transformed, and got the evidence back to our contact.<br /> <br /> I can\u2019t remember the official terms for what all the types of Deviants are (though it\u2019s based on how you were modified), but I do remember what powers we had and their drawbacks. (The powers and drawbacks aren\u2019t inherently linked, there\u2019s apparently going to be some room for customizations.)<br /> <br /> We had a guy who had a literal computer brain (the cyborg type) that gave him access to a bunch of Mental Merits, but he had to have someone open up his brain and replace the batteries (simple AA batteries) every couple of days.<br /> * I played a guy with really weird luck (I think that was called \u2018Atypic,\u2019 and is the catch-all for just really weird stuff), so I got massive bonuses if I ever had to make a chance roll, but the drawback was that the Storyteller could take dice out of my pool because the luck goes both ways.<br /> * We had a character who was effectively boneless (enhanced with injected DNA, I think called a \u2018Chimera\u2019), could fit into almost any space, contort herself however, and lock her body into weird shapes. But she heals at half the normal rate.<br /> * We had a guy who could blank the long-term memories of people around him (the psychic type), either with a focused effect or just making people forget him when he left the room, but his head was massively swollen and he couldn\u2019t pass for human without a sufficient disguise.<br /> * We had a guy who had a bunch of shapeshifter stuff implanted into him (which is a \u2018supernatural stuff spliced into you\u2019 type, sort of like a Cheiron Group hunter dialed up to 11), basically making him something like a werewolf, but he couldn\u2019t talk when transformed.<br /> * And then there was a guy who could literally eat anything (I don\u2019t know what type he was supposed to be, off-hand, there was some wonkiness there), but his mouth was full of teeth made of this glowing alien metal and he also couldn\u2019t pass for human any more without completely covering the lower half of his face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T20:36:46-07:00","id":1244362,"title":"","content":"They sound suitably freakish in appearance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T21:05:13-07:00","id":1244367,"title":"","content":"Yup, i wonder if the atypic will get more work than the others though. It does not exactly sound like a bad deal at all (storywise, not mechanically)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T00:48:19-07:00","id":1244407,"title":"","content":"Atypic is, iirc, one of the names we're changing because I don't like it. The wrexking crew were given the very earliest draft that was &quot;complete&quot; (as in, all chapters present) to build their scenarios from.<br /> <br /> Variations are grouped by Clade with an extra category for Universal ones - you have to have a certain number come from your Clade's list at chargen. Scars are grouped by mental/physical/social and can be combined with Variations howsoever you please.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T05:51:20-07:00","id":1244460,"title":"","content":"If you wanted to go full bio nerd, you could call them the outgroup.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T07:06:50-07:00","id":1244475,"title":"","content":"Anomaly, perhaps? Assuming, of course, that the term isn\u2019t already in use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T08:16:37-07:00","id":1244499,"title":"","content":"I just hope one of the sub splat names is cronenbergs. Also anomaly sounds like a good name","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T08:19:42-07:00","id":1244500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon?p=1244407#post1244407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Atypic is, iirc, one of the names we're changing because I don't like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>So can we describe it as the clade-that-isn't? Ie its members aren't particularly more similar to each other than they are to the other clades?<br /> <br /> If so, what about Anagens? (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anagenesis\" target=\"_blank\">Anagenisis</a> as distinct from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cladogenesis\" target=\"_blank\">cladogenesis</a>)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T08:39:41-07:00","id":1244515,"title":"","content":"Personally, I like how it stays true to being comparatively low level in power and being gross looking. Plus I like how instability works","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T09:50:48-07:00","id":1244531,"title":"","content":"Could pivot towards movies with Coolers or Intacts (from the Cooler and Intacto, respectively).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T20:11:07-07:00","id":1244712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon?p=1244407#post1244407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Atypic is, iirc, one of the names we're changing because I don't like it. The wrexking crew were given the very earliest draft that was &quot;complete&quot; (as in, all chapters present) to build their scenarios from.<br /> <br /> Variations are grouped by Clade with an extra category for Universal ones - you have to have a certain number come from your Clade's list at chargen. Scars are grouped by mental/physical/social and can be combined with Variations howsoever you please.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As I imagined.<br /> <br /> Is it possible to pick up a variation from another Clade?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T02:19:19-07:00","id":1244766,"title":"","content":"If you can think of a way to reskin it for your character's Clade, then yes. The character in the Wrecking Crew demo with the brain implants sounds like an Invasive character that has some Cephalist powers. Or possibly the other way around. I wasn't involved in the games, and don't know how they statted them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T04:15:01-07:00","id":1244776,"title":"","content":"Invasive - Clade for having stuff planted inside you?<br /> Cephalist - Clade for having an expanded mind/awareness/perception sort?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T12:38:57-07:00","id":1244891,"title":"","content":"The sheer variety of abilities you seem to be able to set up for the PCs has me positively giddy, chuffed even.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T18:32:06-07:00","id":1245707,"title":"","content":"Excited to see DtR game terms hinted at in this forum! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Hoping Clades will be the next dev bog post","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T07:03:49-07:00","id":1245866,"title":"","content":"Don't know if we'll do any more blogs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T10:59:44-07:00","id":1245966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon?p=1245866#post1245866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't know if we'll do any more blogs</div> </div> </div> </div> No more blogs? How sad. <br /> Is it that close to being kick started? Or is it more a time constraint thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T11:53:52-07:00","id":1246001,"title":"","content":"I'd say time constraints, the book is still in redlines","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T13:50:57-07:00","id":1246044,"title":"","content":"Yeah. But so is the new v5 book and it\u2019s is set for October.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T14:03:54-07:00","id":1246046,"title":"","content":"True, but Deviant is brand new also","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T14:12:56-07:00","id":1246048,"title":"","content":"It might be that the benefits of open dev aren't proving to be worth the effort put into it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T14:53:03-07:00","id":1246066,"title":"","content":"In any case, the info that has been shared by the devs has convinced me to start saving money for the DtR kickstarter, whenever it may be! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T15:06:37-07:00","id":1246072,"title":"","content":"Right? I\u2019d just like to have a small idea. I spent a lot on geist. Probably won\u2019t be able to do that much for deviant unless it\u2019s awhile out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T19:33:14-07:00","id":1246155,"title":"","content":"MrOwl, I think we'll have some time before the DtR KS<br /> My Personal, Entirely Unofficial thoughts on Kickstarters through 2019 are as follows: <br /> I don't think the DtR Kickstarter will be until 2019. Dystopia Rising starts next week. And V5 Chicago has been put at near October 2019 according to this week's Monday blog. IF there's a third 2019 kickstarter it wouldn't begin until late november 2019, and They Came From Beneath the Sea! is the furthest along of the new lines or books that have been discussed as getting kickstarters. 2019 Kickstarters seem likely to be Contagion Chronicle, Hunter the Vigil 2e, Deviant the Renegade, and Trinity: Aberrant (in order of furthest along in development to least furthest along as of this past Monday. Projects, books and lines not yet on the weekly dev lists seem likely to be a while off, say 2020 or 2021 KS(Mummy the Curse 2e, Scion: Demi-god/God, plus I'm hoping that after a successful Aberrant KS we'll then see Adventure! Trinity, my favorite of the original three Continuum settings).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T10:53:08-07:00","id":1246701,"title":"","content":"I'm very curious to know which Clade fit Hyde, Dorian Gray and Griffyn.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T13:42:23-07:00","id":1246732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon?p=1246701#post1246701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm very curious to know which Clade fit Hyde, Dorian Gray and Griffyn.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based entirely on hints and guessworks about the Clades, my money is Atypic or Chameolon based Chimeric for Griffyn, Atypic for Dorian Gray, and Coactive for Hyde, unless the Hyde was a result of an implanted bit of psycho-pharmacological machinery that periodically renew his formula's presence in his body, in which case I'd say Invasive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T17:39:10-07:00","id":1246824,"title":"","content":"I don't think I'd make Dorian Grey a Remade at all - the painting seems very at odds with the body horror nature of Deviant (I'd use Promethean's mythos for it - the picture was a singular act of genius born out of Basil Hallward's obsession with Dorian, and even Dorian was taken by surprise when its power began to manifest - plus the effects Dorian had on people map quite well to those of the Galatea).<br /> <br /> Griffyn... I'd say his Invisibility is both a stealth power (because he can use it for his benefit) and a physical scar (because he can't turn it off even when it would help). He got it by chemically bleaching his tissues IIRC, and it was a one-off, permanent change - a change of the whole body's makeup might count as Chimeric, even if it doesn't involve animal parts - or Invasive, even if there isn't a lingering implant - though I'm betting Chimeric would have the more fitting variations.<br /> <br /> Hyde, perhaps oddly, I would make Cephalist, at least if I'm going by the original. He was physically human, though he seemed as if he ought to look deformed (but didn't) - that reaction could be a scar. If he had any unusual ability, it was charisma - at one point he talked down an angry mob who'd just seen him trample a six year old girl - which Cephalist variations can probably model better than anything else. From what @DaveBrookshaw said about how the Hulk would work in Deviant, mechanically, I think he'd be Hyde who can turn into Jekyll (suppressing both variation and scar), but is finding it harder and harder to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T01:52:58-07:00","id":1246917,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d probably make some poor bastard the Deviant who\u2019s forced to serve as Dorian Grey\u2019s &quot;portrait&quot; and suffers all the corruption and grief. Dorian\u2019s the bloody conspiracy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T06:59:35-07:00","id":1247004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1243832-deviant-at-gencon?p=1246917#post1246917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019d probably make some poor bastard the Deviant who\u2019s forced to serve as Dorian Grey\u2019s &quot;portrait&quot; and suffers all the corruption and grief. Dorian\u2019s the bloody conspiracy!</div> </div> </div> </div>That's an interesting take!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}